{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/a9d083235c7cee7ebbdc4495c4f59223.avif?t=1742303184\" width=600 height=77 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/f124f592cadf53bc9a88a069a2dd0496.apng?t=1742303184\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/f124f592cadf53bc9a88a069a2dd0496.poster.avif?t=1742303184\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=129 /></picture></span><br>Line up your drones and learn the favorite drink of your intergalactic customers for a super quick service! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/576ce808770954526918c92c6313b5b2.avif?t=1742303184\" width=600 height=77 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/a7f709c4e16648f616c104f132915140.poster.avif?t=1742303184\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/a7f709c4e16648f616c104f132915140.webm?t=1742303184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/a7f709c4e16648f616c104f132915140.mp4?t=1742303184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Stop and serve clients on a fast-paced gameplay that combines <strong>product matching</strong>, <strong>tower defense</strong>, and <strong>real-time strategy</strong> in a new casual way! Espresso, Machiatto, Latte... prepare drinks based on customers' preference and serve them before they exit the conveyor belt.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/76ed1bc6058ec38653cf49a930e4f2fe.avif?t=1742303184\" width=600 height=77 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/12137d09d0e7741fb1cfa0ade37c64e7.avif?t=1742303184\" width=600 height=319 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/b9d55614a0821a4beb9c1c782f69d5e0.apng?t=1742303184\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/b9d55614a0821a4beb9c1c782f69d5e0.poster.avif?t=1742303184\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=200 /></picture></span><br>Navigate the galaxy with 5 different planets, a ton of levels to play, and several hyper speed modes for extra rewards! Clients will range from humans to Murgaks, Gleethe, Antenoids, S.M.O.R.G, or even VIP clients with special caffeine needs.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/ab9bdcc12be9266a83e7e329bba87a36.avif?t=1742303184\" width=600 height=77 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/461d6e8fbea947cc0d4599a8f850737e.poster.avif?t=1742303184\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/461d6e8fbea947cc0d4599a8f850737e.webm?t=1742303184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Manage multiple drones, hire crew members with special abilities to deliver more coffee shots and help you navigate the waves, and overcome unexpected space events that will shake your service!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_im